-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 6\u00aa Meia Maratona Douro Verde 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no dia 21 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 (Domingo) com partida marcada para as 10:00, em Bai\u00e3o, Porto, no concelho de Bai\u00e3o, Porto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no 6\u00aa Meia Maratona Douro Verde 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui os percursos oficiais de 21 km, 21 km em estafeta e 10 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como e onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial em https:\/\/eventsport.pt\/6a-meia-maratona-douro-verde\/.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e log\u00edstica est\u00e1 a cargo de Eventsport.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o assegura dorsal oficial, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos ao longo do percurso e na meta, apoio m\u00e9dico e medalha ou lembran\u00e7a de participa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os finalistas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial detalhado e informa\u00e7\u00f5es de percurso podem ser consultados atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de regulamento indicada nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",